Today we started the Git and Github learnig 
step 1 - 
git init (Apne computer me naya project folder shuru karna)

git clone (GitHub se koi bani-banai file apne laptop par lana)

git add . (Apni files ko save karne ke liye taiyar karna)

git commit -m "Mera pehla change" (Badlavon ko ek naam dekar lock karna)

git push (Apne laptop ka sara kaam internet par GitHub par upload kar dena)


